  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kigali implementation plan (stage I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HFC phase-down management plan (Kigali Implementation Plan KIP) for Senegal will assist the country to meet its obligations under the Kigali Amendment KA  The KIP will include provision for national strategy development, assistance for the implementation of HFC import licensing and quota system, survey, data collection and analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
